  "description": "<p>This personalized anchor doormat adds a nautical touch to any boat, dock, or marina entryway. Featuring vibrant maritime colors and an anchor design, it enhances the aesthetic of marine spaces. It is designed to be a welcoming accent for yacht owners, fishing boats, or anyone who enjoys a coastal lifestyle.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Personalize with boat name, family name, or location</li>\n<li>Features vibrant maritime colors and anchor designs</li>\n<li>Crafted from high-quality polyester and soft memory sponge</li>\n<li>Includes anti-slip pads to keep it securely in place</li>\n<li>Easy to clean and maintain for high-traffic areas</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Flat Woven</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Repellent</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Nautical 04</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Nautical</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Surface/Feel</td>\n<td>Soft Memory Sponge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Spot Clean Only</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Shake outdoors, vacuum, or wipe with a damp cloth</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is suitable for use in cabins, ships, docks, yachts, fishing boats, marina entries, and coastal homes. Its durable construction makes it ideal for both indoor and outdoor environments.</p>",
